      "title": "Start on the positive side",
      "body": "<p>For nonnegative x, replace |x| by x. Find the roots of that quadratic and keep only the ones in this half of the graph.</p>",
      "recap": "Replacing x by |x| reflects the right-hand graph into the left half-plane.",
      "pitfall": "A root of the branch formula can lie outside the branch you are using.",
      "pause": "Sketch the positive side, then check the symmetry of the original expression.",
      "recall": [
