  ],
  "solution": "<p>The function is even. For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02265;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>, it is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>, so its only nonnegative root is 6; reflection gives the other root <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></math>. It is below the axis between these roots.</p><p>The enclosed area is 2<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" aria-label=\"integral from 0 to 6 of (12 plus 4 x minus x squared), with respect to x\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>6</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.18em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" aria-label=\"12 x plus 2 x squared minus x cubed over 3, evaluated from 0 to 6\"><msubsup><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn><mn>6</mn></msubsup></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>72</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>144</mn></mrow></math>.</p><p><strong>Answer E: 144.</strong></p>",
